---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config.mjs';
const updated = 'September 23, 2026';
---
<Page title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE.name}`} heading="Privacy policy" path="/privacy-policy/" updated={updated}
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles data: analytics cookies, Amazon affiliate links, what we collect, and your choices under U.S. privacy law.`}>
  <p>This policy explains what information {SITE.name} ("we", "us") collects when you visit {SITE.url.replace('https://', '')} and how it's used. We keep it short because we collect very little.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>We don't ask for personal information.</strong> There are no accounts, comment forms or newsletter sign-ups on this site.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 to understand which guides are read and which links are clicked. Google Analytics uses cookies and collects data such as pages viewed, approximate location (city/country), device and browser type, and referring website. It does not give us your name or email. Learn more at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">How Google uses data from sites that use its services</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) processes standard technical data such as IP address and user agent to deliver the site securely.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Amazon Associates and affiliate links</h2>
  <p>{SITE.name} is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program. When you click a link to Amazon, Amazon may set cookies on your device to attribute purchases to us. Amazon's use of your data is governed by the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GX7NJQ4ZB8MHFRNJ" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Amazon.com Privacy Notice</a>. Third parties, including Amazon and other advertisers, may serve content and advertisements, collect information directly from visitors, and place or recognize cookies on visitors' browsers.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and your choices</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, and you can opt out of Google Analytics with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>. The site works normally without cookies.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live (for example, California under the CCPA/CPRA), you may have the right to know what personal information is collected, to request deletion, and to opt out of the "sale" or "sharing" of personal information. We do not sell personal information. To make a request, contact us using the details below.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is intended for adults and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy we'll update the date at the top of this page.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>{SITE.address}{SITE.contactEmail && <> · <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a></>}</p>
</Page>
